From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lenOS <security@lenos.invalid>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 20:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] lenOS: add security UI and per-connection MAC selector

GrapheneOS 16 QPR2 provenance:
- 28e9cd1c413c96f592acaf94d907ebfe0d84ca8f (credential error converter)
- 0a49b2cb8931c200d0234ccc17cecbedca02ce3c (duress management UI)
- f367867e351f091e503de88722da5e5a62cbfa59 (per-connection MAC UI)
- 02dd52e3d73f43517cd0ac2a7e688749627bc87f (auto-reboot UI design)

Adapted to LineageOS Security > More security settings without importing the
GrapheneOS extension framework. Duress activities are internal-only, available
only to the secured Owner, and the automatic BFU picker uses an authenticated
preference. Default timeout is 18 hours. Development-only Wi-Fi stack-trace
logging from the upstream change is deliberately omitted.

